2. SABLE-3 MINI: PRICE AND FIRST NUMBERS
$0.18 / $0.72 per million tokens. On our extraction set it scores 86.4, four points off the full model at 6% of the output price. It is the best price-per-point in the table this week.

3. KESTREL COMPUTE BATCH TIER
40% off real-time pricing for 24-hour async jobs, all hosted models. We confirmed the discount applies to the full token count, not input only.

4. PRICE CHANGES THIS WEEK
  Kestrel batch tier: -40% (new)
  Nimbus Inference, Quillon-L: -10% output
  Argent Systems: no change

